    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-measurement-interlock-shear-capacity-over-apex-plate-bending-capacity-pi-sliding-first-if-1> a schema:PropertyValue,
